%% title: How online admission works
%% desc: The office opens an admission round; a guardian submits the form on a phone and gets a reference number; the office reviews and admits the application; a student and guardian are created; the guardian checks the status with the reference number and mobile number.
flowchart LR
  P["Office: Add admission round<br/>section, seats, dates, documents"] --> O["Round is open"]
  O --> F["Guardian: admission form on a phone<br/>Submit application"]
  F --> R["Reference number"]
  F --> A["Admission applicants<br/>Awaiting review"]
  A -->|"Admit"| S["New student<br/>and guardian"]:::done
  R --> T["Guardian: Check application status"]
  A -.->|"SMS"| T
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
